--- body ---
## Context
Discharges the last exit criterion of 1084 (remeasure turns per roar), which cannot be
met before 1084 merges: it needs roars run with `skills/roar/close-and-clean.sh`.
Baseline (1084 body, padme 2026-10-11, 400 sessions, 75 roars): median 16 turns starting at
215k context, ~420k cache-read input equivalents per roar; 29 roars start above 256k.
1084's estimate of ~40% saving is derived (8-10 of 16 turns assumed mechanical), not measured.

## Exit criteria
- [x] Turns and cache-read equivalents measured, by the baseline's method, on at least 10 roars run after 1084 merged; before/after table in the journal
- [x] The derived ~40% estimate is replaced by the measured figure, or the gap is explained
